      "description": "Deflected doubleweave, towel3. The18× threading repeat gives444 threaded ends plus two floating selvedges. Both hems contain16 repeats of their two-pick plain weave. The upper and lower24-pick border units each repeat4 times. Repeat the eight-pick central unit to19 inches; one repeat is encoded because the source specifies this section by length. Cottolin colors are Magenta, Orange and Chocolate; finer Brun Chocolat is used in the hems.",
