      "description": "The published Wandering Vine overshot top border. Numbered pattern circles are expanded into1,2 or3 picks. Use alternating tabby between pattern picks and weave the specified plain-weave intervals between the three overshot bands. The source calls for349 warp ends plus two floating selvedges; this transcription preserves the legible numeric threading cells and repeat brackets. The full towel also uses3-inch bottom/top plain weave,8-,7-,6- and5-inch body intervals, and a1-inch top hem.",
