      "id": "hw-2018-05-06-p042-s70",
      "title": "Black Windows Pillow",
      "pages": "40–42",
      "designer": "Lea Vennix",
      "description": "Doubleweave with supplementary warp and weft, using the twelve-shaft lift plan. Chenille and wool form contrasting puffed areas after wet finishing; the drawdown shows the interlacement before shrinkage. Sley chenille four ends per dent and follow the source’s grouped wool/chenille denting for the main body. Repeat the lift plan to the required length, then machine wash and gently dry to develop the texture. Floating selvedges are not included in the shaft draft.",
