      "manualTechnique": "On a rigid heddle beginning with a hole at right, select slot ends 3 up, then(1 down,1 up)22 times,1 down,2 up. Pick-up shed uses neutral heddle with stick on edge. Weave 3 inches plain, then 5 repeats of pickup/doubled contrast, up/main, down/main. Follow with 5 repeats of up,pickup,up,down in main color; weave one up pick and repeat the supplementary border 5 times. Weave plain to 60 inches total, repeat this border, then 3 inches plain. Silver version swaps Grape and Silver.",
