      "manualTechnique": "Wind all 8 mop-cotton colors together: Jaune Or, Mauve, Olive, Stone, Royal, Peacock, Slate and Noir. Weave 10 picks S twist then 10 picks Z twist. Before closing each shed, twist the bundle toward you for right-to-left S picks and away for left-to-right S picks; reverse those motions for Z picks. Beat after twisting. Add one floating selvedge at each side to total 312 ends. Use doubled Forest for 2-inch hems or 4-pick fringe headers.",
