      "manualTechnique": "Prepare 1½-inch blue rag strips; cut natural jelly-roll strips 1¼inches wide. Make 220 natural trapezoids 8 inches long with 2-inch end tapers, and 110 blue center trapezoids 12 inches long with 2-inch tapers. Weave 2-inch doubled-cotton hem, then 20 blue picks. Alternate a solid-blue pick with a spliced pick: blue side, natural insert, centered blue insert, natural insert, blue side; overlap the matching tapered ends. Cycle 10 natural fabric patterns 11 times. Finish with 20 blue picks and 2-inch hem.",
